# ts-monolith agent defaults

Follow [docs/RULEBOOK.md](docs/RULEBOOK.md). Keep this rule short on purpose (always-on tokens).

## Code

- Services: interfaces only — never Prisma, Fastify, or queue clients.
- Routes: Zod validate → factory → response; no domain branching in HTTP.
- Cross-module data: owning module’s interface/service only.
- Domain failures: `AppError` subclasses, not bare `Error`.
- External libs: `shared/providers/` contracts; wire in factories.
- Tenant-owned data: scoped access + isolation tests.
- Prefer `scaffold:module`; run `lint:architecture` after new deps.
- HTTP contract changes: export/check OpenAPI; no duplicated FE/BE shapes.

## Tokens / chat

- One task per chat; hand off with goal + `@` files / short plan — don’t archive in-thread.
- `/summarize` between phases; don’t paste large logs/diffs (use paths).
- Explore in Ask/subagent; implement in a clean thread.
- Prefer Plan mode before multi-file thrash; stop and restart if stuck.
